  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Namibia Performance management and M&amp;E</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This task will consist of technical assistance to the Government of  Namibia to help establish a results-based M&amp;E system by strengthening the design and implementation of such a system through technical support and analytical work. This task will support an IDF application as well as a brief policy note on good practices in M&amp;E. The objective of the IDF Grant is to improve the capacity of the National Planning Commission of the Government of Namibia to design and implement an efficient monitoring and evaluation system of National Development Plans and aid contributions.</narrative>
  </description>
